/// Middleware to inject security headers into all responses (SEC-01).
///
/// Implements:
/// - Content-Security-Policy (CSP)
/// - Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS - conditional on HTTPS)
/// - X-Content-Type-Options (nosniff)
/// - X-Frame-Options (DENY)
