                "tool_call",
                "{\"tool\":\"ls\"}",
            )
            .await
            .unwrap();
        assert_eq!(e1.prev_hash, GENESIS_PREV_HASH);
        assert_eq!(e1.seq, Some(1));

        let e2 = audit
            .record(
                "agent-1",
